        <content type="html" xml:base="https://aw2.help/builds/power-dragonhunter-radiance/">&lt;p&gt;This build is focused on doing damage almost exclusively with hammer, with extremely low apm.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Higher vitality from this build makes solo play viable.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
